{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39102","headline":"题盘豆驿水馆後轩 · 韦庄","name":"题盘豆驿水馆後轩","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"极目晴川展画屏，地从桃塞接蒲城。\n滩头鹭占清波立，原上人侵落照耕。\n去鴈数行天际没，孤云一点净中生。\n冯轩尽日不回首，楚水吴山无限情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39102.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39102","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}